ultz became a program Management Director."}, "D4S7": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0223-4c5567fc9fea:d03", "start": 514, "end": 669, "text": "In 2011, Schultz became Senior Vice President and Chief Operating Officer of SENTEL Corporation, which provides technology development and testing services"}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0223-4c5567fc9fea:d04", "start": 0, "end": 149, "text": "Army National Guard , May 21 , 1996 Major general , Army National Guard , June 1 , 1998 Lieutenant general , May 24 , 2001 References [ edit ] ^ U.S."}, "D5S2": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0223-4c5567fc9fea:d04", "start": 150, "end": 371, "text": "Senate Armed Services Committee , Hearing Record Archived February 4 , 2011 , at the Wayback Machine , Subcommittee on Airland Forces Hearing on Modernization of the United States Army , March 24 , 1999 , pages 2-3 ^ U.S."}, "D5S3": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0223-4c5567fc9fea:d04", "start": 372, "end": 500, "text": "House Appropriations Committee , Hearing Record , Department of Defense Appropriations for 2006 , Biographical sketch , Roger C."}, "D5S4": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0223-4c5567fc9fea:d04", "start": 501, "end": 532, "text": "Schultz , 2006 , page 43 ^ U.S."}, "D5S5": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0223-4c5567fc9fea:d04", "start": 533, "end": 538, "text": "House"}, "D6S1": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0223-4c5567fc9fea:d05", "start": 0, "end": 471, "text": "March 31 , 1976 Lieutenant colonel , Army National Guard , February 10 , 1981 Colonel , Army National Guard , February 1 , 1985 Brigadier general , Army National Guard , May 21 , 1996 Major general , Army National Guard , June 1 , 1998 Lieutenant general , May 24 , 2001 Related Research Articles The Army National Guard ( ARNG ) , in conjunction with the Air National Guard , is an organized militia force and a federal military reserve force of the United States Army ."}, "D6S2":